 Sheet:\n•  Apply foundation and powder matching skintone\n•  L
 ight skin tone eye shadow over entire eye\n•  Dark brown eye shadow
  over crease\n•  Medium brown eye shadow blended over brown\n• 
  Black fake eyelashes (note: apply mascara to own lashes before appli
 cation of fake lashes)\n•  Apply eyeliner after lashes dry\n• 
